      "y": 578,
      "width": 528,
      "height": 72,
      "text": "On startup each sim pod calls  GET /api/plcs/{id}/config  and self-builds\nits OPC-UA address space (output + writable-input nodes). The backend\nthen browses it identically to a real PLC.",
